        "description": "Presence of interictal nystagmus on neurological exam",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of recurrent cerebellar ataxia episodes with vertigo plus identification of CACNA1A mutation or typical clinical presentation with supportive findings",
    "notes": "Genetic testing is critical for confirmation; clinical presentation can overlap with other episodic ataxias."
